      "section_title": "STOP",
      "section_url": "https://github.com/apache/thrift/blob/master/doc/specs/thrift-binary-protocol.md",
      "paragraph": "A struct is a sequence of fields ended by type STOP (0x00).",
      "requirement": "MUST",
      "expect": "accept",
      "input": "00",
      "input_encoding": "hex"
    },
    {
      "id": "thrift-bool-true",
      "title": "Bool field 1 = true",
      "section": "Field",
      "section_title": "BOOL",
      "section_url": "https://github.com/apache/thrift/blob/master/doc/specs/thrift-binary-protocol.md",
      "paragraph": "Type 2 is bool. The field header is type + i16 id, then one byte 0 or 1.",
      "requirement": "MUST",
      "expect": "accept",
      "input": "02000101 00",
      "input_encoding": "hex"
    },
    {
      "id": "thrift-i32",
